amed after the patch, sized by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/accessibilityRotor(_:entries:entryLabel:)-6ra1c":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"accessibilityRotor"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"EntryModel"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Text","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4TextV"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"entries"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"EntryModel"},{"kind":"text","text":"], "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"entryLabel"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"KeyPath","preciseIdentifier":"s:s7KeyPathC"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"EntryModel"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":">) -> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"View","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/accessibilityrotor(_:entries:entrylabel:)-6ra1c","abstract":[],"title":"accessibilityRotor(_:entries:entryLabel:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/accessibilityRotor(_:entries:entryLabel:)-6ra1c","kind":"symbol","type":"topic"}}}